        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki enkatampoi aitoip ilo ng'obor le ntumo, neiput enkitoo o Laitoriani ina aji e Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitu eidim Musa atijing'a atua ilo ng'obor le ntumo, amu etobikie enkatampoi shumata ninye, neiput enkitoo o Laitoriani ilo ng'obor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tiatua ilotot enye pooki, enkata ake nayae ina atampoi aaiwuang'ie teilo ng'obor, nepuo iltung'ana loo Siraeli dukuya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake teneitu eyae ina atampoi aailepie, neitu ninche epuo, ometabau ina olong nayae aailepie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore tiatua ilolot enye pooki netii enkatampoi o Laitoriani shumata ilo ng'obor dama, netii enkima atua ninye kewarie, te dukuya ina aji pooki e Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.38"
            ]
          }
